  unitName: Unicorn
  unitId: 50060
  unitNumber: 95
  description: A mythical creature with a single large horn on its brow. It resembles
    a beautiful white horse, and rarely gets close to humans. It will only open its
    heart to those with unstained souls. They can sense ulterior motives immediately
    thanks to their telepathy. Many try to capture them for the medicine in their
    horns, but usually end up getting pierced instead.
  summonDesc: Child who stands before me,<br>heed these words...<br>Beware your impure
    heart.
  fusionDesc: You heart is pure.<br>I hope you stay that way.
